{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"lmb_f5y_bg8","canonical_person_id":"lmb_f5y_bg8","id_aliases":[],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["lmb_f5y_bg8"],"persons":[{"id":"lmb_f5y_bg8","label":"黃義（淮南衡山列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"黃義","mention_ids":["c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0544"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0544","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p020","quote":"黃義"}]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji118-huainan","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-118","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0544"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-118-huainan:p020"],"table_cell_ids":[],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji118-huainan"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0544","start":544,"end":546,"surface":"黃義","kind":"person","person_id":"lmb_f5y_bg8","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p020","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p020","text":"王有孽子不害，最長，王弗愛，王、王后、太子皆不以為子兄數。不害有子建，材高有氣，常怨望太子不省其父；又怨時諸侯皆得分子弟為侯，而淮南獨二子，一為太子，建父獨不得為侯。建陰結交，欲告敗太子，以其父代之。太子知之，數捕繋而榜笞建。建具知太子之謀欲殺漢中尉，即使所善壽春莊芷以元朔六年上書於天子曰：「毒藥苦於口利於病，忠言逆於耳利於行。今淮南王孫建，材能高，淮南王王后荼、荼子太子遷常疾害建。建父不害無罪，擅數捕繋，欲殺之。今建在，可徵問，具知淮南陰事。」書聞，上以其事下廷尉，廷尉下河南治。是時故辟陽侯孫審卿善丞相公孫弘，怨淮南厲王殺其大父，乃深購淮南事於弘，弘乃疑淮南有畔逆計謀，深窮治其獄。河南治建，辭引淮南太子及黨與。淮南王患之，欲發，問伍被曰：「漢廷治亂？」伍被曰：「天下治。」王意不說，謂伍被曰：「公何以言天下治也？」被曰：「被竊觀朝廷之政，君臣之義，父子之親，夫婦之別，長幼之序，皆得其理，上之舉錯遵古之道，風俗紀綱未有所缺也。重裝富賈，周流天下，道無不通，故交易之道行。南越賓服，羌僰入獻，東甌入降，廣長榆，開朔方，匈奴折翅傷翼，失援不振。雖未及古太平之時，然猶為治也。」王怒，被謝死罪。王又謂被曰：「山東即有兵，漢必使大將軍將而制山東，公以為大將軍何如人也？」被曰：「被所善者黃義，從大將軍擊匈奴，還，告被曰：『大將軍遇士大夫有禮，於士卒有恩，眾皆樂為之用。騎上下山若蜚，材干絕人。』被以為材能如此，數將習兵，未易當也。及謁者曹梁使長安來，言大將軍號令明，當敵勇敢，常為士卒先。休舍，穿井未通，須士卒盡得水，乃敢飲。軍罷，卒盡已度河，乃度。皇太后所賜金帛，盡以賜軍吏。雖古名將弗過也。」王默然。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"不害","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0014","start":14,"end":15,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"王后","kind":"person","person_id":"8ie_pfa_02i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFAC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"不害","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"建","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFABA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m020-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"太子","kind":